    <md:content-id>m02373</md:content-id>
    <md:title>9.3.3: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>956f9514-7d46-44e2-bd21-1d4084094441</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para>Examine the work shown. Which of the following is the error that took place when the equation was solved by completing the square?</para>
<para>\(x^2-6x-7=0\)</para>
<para>\(x^2-6x=7\)</para>
<para>\(x^2-6x+9=16\)</para>
<para>\((x-3)^2=16\)</para>
<para>\(x-3=4\)</para>
<para>\(x=7\)</para></section>
</content>
</document>
